h can\nlocally be cut out by at most $c$ elements of the structure sheaf.\nThen $\\mathcal{H}^i_Z(\\mathcal{F}) = 0$ for $i > c$ and any\nquasi-coherent $\\mathcal{O}_X$-module $\\mathcal{F}$.", "statement_truncated": false}
